{"4104610": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "异星战争", "steam_appid": 4104610, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>（移动端Taptap新春特惠活动已开启，只要12元就可征战完整异星战场！快去搜索 异星战争 把完整版移动端异星战争带回家吧！）</i></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>（官方已入驻爱发电，搜索 “龙涯游戏”，认准官方号哦</i></strong>。<strong>无论是“请作者吃个鸡腿”，还是“请喝杯奶茶”，或是随缘的打赏，都是对我最大的认可与助力。<i>）</i></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>************** 游     戏    背   景 **************</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >游戏设定为几百年后的未来，地球因为各种原因不适合生存，于是派遣了大量飞船去太空探索新的宜居星球，玩家扮演的是其中一艘陷入神秘星球的飞船的舰长。派遣登陆舰登陆星球在一波又一波强大怪物的进攻下生存下来并探索星球的秘密。</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>游戏的核心玩法为卡牌构筑+RTS，有塔防，有策略，更有 Roguelike收割爽感的超强融合。</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104610/extras/0a47d6586ef0fd726dca79c569c745cc.poster.avif?t=1772120974\" width=1170 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104610/extras/0a47d6586ef0fd726dca79c569c745cc.webm?t=1772120974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104610/extras/0a47d6586ef0fd726dca79c569c745cc.mp4?t=1772120974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>游戏设置有普通模式，变异模式，无尽挑战三种模式。</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >普通模式提供了多个难度供玩家挑战，最高难度挑战成功可以解锁隐藏成就。</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >变异模式是普通模式的强化版本，怪物将拥有特殊能力，实力大幅提升。玩家可携带多个6星神器，战局更紧张、更刺激。</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >无尽挑战为变异模式的无尽版本。无尽模式提供了<i><strong>“规则武器”</strong></i>这一特色道具，通过规则武器的组合可以获得强大的战斗内加成和更丰富的战斗体验。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104610/extras/dddeeb96c9240e907e6bded85545d379.poster.avif?t=1772120974\" width=1170 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104610/extras/dddeeb96c9240e907e6bded85545d379.webm?t=1772120974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104610/extras/dddeeb96c9240e907e6bded85545d379.mp4?t=1772120974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>************** 战  斗  内 **************</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >卡牌：游戏遵循卡牌构筑游戏的基本玩法，玩家初始只有少量的初始卡牌，需要在游戏中通过怪物掉落，商店购买等方式来获得更多更高级的卡牌来构筑自己的卡组，还可以通过合成来获得各种超强的卡牌。构筑出想要的卡组需要有选择地获取卡牌，并关注”权值信息”，某一系别权值比重越高，该系别的卡牌出现概率越大，切莫贪多。</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >神器：可以提供被动加成。神器类似于卡牌，根据玩家的选择不同会获得不同的构筑路线。神器的获得有随机性，但是神器能提供远比科技强大而又丰富的加成。</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>注意，决定构筑权重的是卡牌，神器不会影响构筑路线。</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104610/extras/7b2eaaf8b039e181617ac28f5b8cf22c.poster.avif?t=1772120974\" width=1170 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104610/extras/7b2eaaf8b039e181617ac28f5b8cf22c.webm?t=1772120974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104610/extras/7b2eaaf8b039e181617ac28f5b8cf22c.mp4?t=1772120974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>战斗中设计了“金币”、“能量”两种资源。</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >金币是战斗内的主要消耗资源，战斗内购买物品，升级科技，合成等操作都需要消耗金币。建筑卡和军队卡也需要消耗金币。金币的主要获取途径为挖掘类建筑，资源卡，野外矿物以及怪物掉落。</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 能量是战术卡和辅助卡所消耗的资源。能量的获取途径为发电类建筑以及资源卡。</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104610/extras/60576d018ba9409eb1b1ed83b386edce.poster.avif?t=1772120974\" width=1170 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104610/extras/60576d018ba9409eb1b1ed83b386edce.webm?t=1772120974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104610/extras/60576d018ba9409eb1b1ed83b386edce.mp4?t=1772120974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >科技：和其他游戏的科技类似，科技是战斗内通过消耗金币来获得各种加成以及解锁其他功能的功能。通过消耗金币解锁与升级。</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >车间：通过消耗低级卡牌和金币，获得高级卡牌。合成功能中的高级卡牌通常代表着构筑路线。</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104610/extras/4affae843bcb7fa23858be6609929b07.poster.avif?t=1772120974\" width=1170 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104610/extras/4affae843bcb7fa23858be6609929b07.webm?t=1772120974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104610/extras/4affae843bcb7fa23858be6609929b07.mp4?t=1772120974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>**************局         外**************</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >局内战斗结束后会奖励”钻石“，&quot;钻石&quot;可以用于局外的 飞船升级，解锁地图皮肤以及指挥官升级。</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >飞船升级：战斗外的主要养成功能。通过升级飞船可以获得一些全局加成以及科技点数。科技点数可以在战斗开始前的加点功能中对战斗内的全局属性进行加点。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >地图皮肤：主要是用来提供不同的视觉体验的，部分皮肤可以提供少量加成，比如冰川就可以提供冰系伤害加成，同时削减火系伤害。</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >指挥官：不同的指挥官提供了不同的初始牌组以及不同的初始全局属性。指挥官可以升级，升级后的指挥官能给这一局战斗提供更多的加成。</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104610/extras/6edb159a36f63230b0e5ae2ce65eacc0.poster.avif?t=1772120974\" width=1170 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104610/extras/6edb159a36f63230b0e5ae2ce65eacc0.webm?t=1772120974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104610/extras/6edb159a36f63230b0e5ae2ce65eacc0.mp4?t=1772120974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>**************军   队   操   作 **************</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >熟悉的 RTS 味儿，整体移动逻辑跟传统RTS游戏一脉相承。</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>👀 视野移动</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >鼠标移到屏幕边缘 ：自动滑动视角 <br>长按键盘方向键：精细微调视角 <br>单击空格键 ： 瞬间切回主基地视野 </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🖱️ 选择单位</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >单击左键 ： 选中单个单位 <br>双击左键 ： 选中全部同类单位 <br>按住左键拖拽 ：自由框选多个单位 <br>单击F2：一键全选所有己方单位 </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🚶 单位行为</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >右键单击地面：向目的地移动 <br>右键单击地面 + A键 ：向目的地边打边推进 <br>单击H：原地坚守 </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🔢 编队管理</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >选中单位后 Ctrl + 数字键：创建编队 <br>选中单位后 Shift + 数字键：将单位加入已有编队 <br>单击数字键：选中该编队全部单位 <br>双击数字键：视角瞬间跳到该编队所在位置</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>（移动端Taptap新春特惠活动已开启，只要12元就可征战完整异星战场！快去搜索 异星战争 把完整版移动端异星战争带回家吧！）</i></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>（官方已入驻爱发电，搜索 “龙涯游戏”，认准官方号哦</i></strong>。<strong>无论是“请作者吃个鸡腿”，还是“请喝杯奶茶”，或是随缘的打赏，都是对我最大的认可与助力。<i>）</i></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>************** 游     戏    背   景 **************</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >游戏设定为几百年后的未来，地球因为各种原因不适合生存，于是派遣了大量飞船去太空探索新的宜居星球，玩家扮演的是其中一艘陷入神秘星球的飞船的舰长。派遣登陆舰登陆星球在一波又一波强大怪物的进攻下生存下来并探索星球的秘密。</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>游戏的核心玩法为卡牌构筑+RTS，有塔防，有策略，更有 Roguelike收割爽感的超强融合。</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104610/extras/0a47d6586ef0fd726dca79c569c745cc.poster.avif?t=1772120974\" width=1170 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104610/extras/0a47d6586ef0fd726dca79c569c745cc.webm?t=1772120974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104610/extras/0a47d6586ef0fd726dca79c569c745cc.mp4?t=1772120974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>游戏设置有普通模式，变异模式，无尽挑战三种模式。</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >普通模式提供了多个难度供玩家挑战，最高难度挑战成功可以解锁隐藏成就。</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >变异模式是普通模式的强化版本，怪物将拥有特殊能力，实力大幅提升。玩家可携带多个6星神器，战局更紧张、更刺激。</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >无尽挑战为变异模式的无尽版本。无尽模式提供了<i><strong>“规则武器”</strong></i>这一特色道具，通过规则武器的组合可以获得强大的战斗内加成和更丰富的战斗体验。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104610/extras/dddeeb96c9240e907e6bded85545d379.poster.avif?t=1772120974\" width=1170 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104610/extras/dddeeb96c9240e907e6bded85545d379.webm?t=1772120974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104610/extras/dddeeb96c9240e907e6bded85545d379.mp4?t=1772120974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>************** 战  斗  内 **************</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >卡牌：游戏遵循卡牌构筑游戏的基本玩法，玩家初始只有少量的初始卡牌，需要在游戏中通过怪物掉落，商店购买等方式来获得更多更高级的卡牌来构筑自己的卡组，还可以通过合成来获得各种超强的卡牌。构筑出想要的卡组需要有选择地获取卡牌，并关注”权值信息”，某一系别权值比重越高，该系别的卡牌出现概率越大，切莫贪多。</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >神器：可以提供被动加成。神器类似于卡牌，根据玩家的选择不同会获得不同的构筑路线。神器的获得有随机性，但是神器能提供远比科技强大而又丰富的加成。</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>注意，决定构筑权重的是卡牌，神器不会影响构筑路线。</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104610/extras/7b2eaaf8b039e181617ac28f5b8cf22c.poster.avif?t=1772120974\" width=1170 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104610/extras/7b2eaaf8b039e181617ac28f5b8cf22c.webm?t=1772120974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104610/extras/7b2eaaf8b039e181617ac28f5b8cf22c.mp4?t=1772120974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>战斗中设计了“金币”、“能量”两种资源。</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >金币是战斗内的主要消耗资源，战斗内购买物品，升级科技，合成等操作都需要消耗金币。建筑卡和军队卡也需要消耗金币。金币的主要获取途径为挖掘类建筑，资源卡，野外矿物以及怪物掉落。</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 能量是战术卡和辅助卡所消耗的资源。能量的获取途径为发电类建筑以及资源卡。</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104610/extras/60576d018ba9409eb1b1ed83b386edce.poster.avif?t=1772120974\" width=1170 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104610/extras/60576d018ba9409eb1b1ed83b386edce.webm?t=1772120974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104610/extras/60576d018ba9409eb1b1ed83b386edce.mp4?t=1772120974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >科技：和其他游戏的科技类似，科技是战斗内通过消耗金币来获得各种加成以及解锁其他功能的功能。通过消耗金币解锁与升级。</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >车间：通过消耗低级卡牌和金币，获得高级卡牌。合成功能中的高级卡牌通常代表着构筑路线。</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104610/extras/4affae843bcb7fa23858be6609929b07.poster.avif?t=1772120974\" width=1170 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104610/extras/4affae843bcb7fa23858be6609929b07.webm?t=1772120974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104610/extras/4affae843bcb7fa23858be6609929b07.mp4?t=1772120974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>**************局         外**************</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >局内战斗结束后会奖励”钻石“，&quot;钻石&quot;可以用于局外的 飞船升级，解锁地图皮肤以及指挥官升级。</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >飞船升级：战斗外的主要养成功能。通过升级飞船可以获得一些全局加成以及科技点数。科技点数可以在战斗开始前的加点功能中对战斗内的全局属性进行加点。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >地图皮肤：主要是用来提供不同的视觉体验的，部分皮肤可以提供少量加成，比如冰川就可以提供冰系伤害加成，同时削减火系伤害。</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >指挥官：不同的指挥官提供了不同的初始牌组以及不同的初始全局属性。指挥官可以升级，升级后的指挥官能给这一局战斗提供更多的加成。</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104610/extras/6edb159a36f63230b0e5ae2ce65eacc0.poster.avif?t=1772120974\" width=1170 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104610/extras/6edb159a36f63230b0e5ae2ce65eacc0.webm?t=1772120974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104610/extras/6edb159a36f63230b0e5ae2ce65eacc0.mp4?t=1772120974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>**************军   队   操   作 **************</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >熟悉的 RTS 味儿，整体移动逻辑跟传统RTS游戏一脉相承。</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>👀 视野移动</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >鼠标移到屏幕边缘 ：自动滑动视角 <br>长按键盘方向键：精细微调视角 <br>单击空格键 ： 瞬间切回主基地视野 </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🖱️ 选择单位</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >单击左键 ： 选中单个单位 <br>双击左键 ： 选中全部同类单位 <br>按住左键拖拽 ：自由框选多个单位 <br>单击F2：一键全选所有己方单位 </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🚶 单位行为</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >右键单击地面：向目的地移动 <br>右键单击地面 + A键 ：向目的地边打边推进 <br>单击H：原地坚守 </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🔢 编队管理</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >选中单位后 Ctrl + 数字键：创建编队 <br>选中单位后 Shift + 数字键：将单位加入已有编队 <br>单击数字键：选中该编队全部单位 <br>双击数字键：视角瞬间跳到该编队所在位置</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "本游戏玩法结合了肉鸽，卡牌构筑，即时战略，塔防等元素。作为指挥官的你在一个随机生成的星球上，通过构筑卡组和神器，建造建筑和军队，升级科技，改变地形以及使用强大的武器来抵御茫茫多的强大敌人。虽然第一次玩需要一定的时间熟悉，但是上手之后还是有些上头的，希望大家喜欢。", "supported_languages": "Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104610/e9cd9c547501dfdcae39c6951cf6289e991e4fa4/header.jpg?t=1772120974", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104610/885077bbd7d3c05b408d64d5600d39454fcf622e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772120974", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104610/885077bbd7d3c05b408d64d5600d39454fcf622e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772120974", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> <br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> <br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> <br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> <br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> <br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> <br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Longya Game"], "publishers": ["Longya Game"], "demos": [{"appid": 4224630, "description": ""}], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "23", "description": "Indie"}, {"id": "28", "description": "Simulation"}, {"id": "2", "description": "Strategy"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104610/edc15c1ca7df28bca5d2dd468aea7114267f1446/ss_edc15c1ca7df28bca5d2dd468aea7114267f1446.600x338.jpg?t=1772120974", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104610/edc15c1ca7df28bca5d2dd468aea7114267f1446/ss_edc15c1ca7df28bca5d2dd468aea7114267f1446.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772120974"}, {"id": 1, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104610/e7a9f5c78a92ab52c0a7c4c692855ac3e456df5f/ss_e7a9f5c78a92ab52c0a7c4c692855ac3e456df5f.600x338.jpg?t=1772120974", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104610/e7a9f5c78a92ab52c0a7c4c692855ac3e456df5f/ss_e7a9f5c78a92ab52c0a7c4c692855ac3e456df5f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772120974"}, {"id": 2, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104610/7d917f3096bbf468459cbef25b06afa30f80baeb/ss_7d917f3096bbf468459cbef25b06afa30f80baeb.600x338.jpg?t=1772120974", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104610/7d917f3096bbf468459cbef25b06afa30f80baeb/ss_7d917f3096bbf468459cbef25b06afa30f80baeb.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772120974"}, {"id": 3, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104610/fc10bb40b9f98cd8778bb69da7046191df48382e/ss_fc10bb40b9f98cd8778bb69da7046191df48382e.600x338.jpg?t=1772120974", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104610/fc10bb40b9f98cd8778bb69da7046191df48382e/ss_fc10bb40b9f98cd8778bb69da7046191df48382e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772120974"}, {"id": 4, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104610/b94c226ece52e85e2ff4b45cce729e5643512425/ss_b94c226ece52e85e2ff4b45cce729e5643512425.600x338.jpg?t=1772120974", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104610/b94c226ece52e85e2ff4b45cce729e5643512425/ss_b94c226ece52e85e2ff4b45cce729e5643512425.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772120974"}, {"id": 5, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104610/34b04603bbed456d93a52d134cff04bf420e0fd7/ss_34b04603bbed456d93a52d134cff04bf420e0fd7.600x338.jpg?t=1772120974", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104610/34b04603bbed456d93a52d134cff04bf420e0fd7/ss_34b04603bbed456d93a52d134cff04bf420e0fd7.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772120974"}, {"id": 6, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104610/719658e182476675b9ad17bd4b119f70525583ba/ss_719658e182476675b9ad17bd4b119f70525583ba.600x338.jpg?t=1772120974", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104610/719658e182476675b9ad17bd4b119f70525583ba/ss_719658e182476675b9ad17bd4b119f70525583ba.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772120974"}, {"id": 7, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104610/201ba9b2f11d645064e8afd586c848e2b06d629a/ss_201ba9b2f11d645064e8afd586c848e2b06d629a.600x338.jpg?t=1772120974", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104610/201ba9b2f11d645064e8afd586c848e2b06d629a/ss_201ba9b2f11d645064e8afd586c848e2b06d629a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772120974"}], "movies": [{"id": 257216037, "name": "异星战争", "thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257216037/9d6688525fc6a910d5133ec5ec9d8db56e5ffa3c/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1767631152", "dash_av1": "https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4104610/2046096846/020d8f1991eb8b425f6d543fe74066616cb54987/1767624428/dash_av1.mpd?t=1767631152", "dash_h264": "https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4104610/2046096846/020d8f1991eb8b425f6d543fe74066616cb54987/1767624428/dash_h264.mpd?t=1767631152", "hls_h264": "https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4104610/2046096846/020d8f1991eb8b425f6d543fe74066616cb54987/1767624428/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1767631152", "highlight": true}, {"id": 257259914, "name": "真机试玩", "thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257259914/6b03290d28d5a82a5bdcde50184e692d4ad3cc0a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1767631153", "dash_av1": "https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4104610/1618201295/0044d61aaf3b1745d17428b8dbeb95f90976b587/1767628875/dash_av1.mpd?t=1767631153", "dash_h264": "https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4104610/1618201295/0044d61aaf3b1745d17428b8dbeb95f90976b587/1767628875/dash_h264.mpd?t=1767631153", "hls_h264": "https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4104610/1618201295/0044d61aaf3b1745d17428b8dbeb95f90976b587/1767628875/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1767631153", "highlight": true}], "release_date": {"coming_soon": true, "date": "Coming soon"}, "support_info": {"url": "", "email": "3406713122@qq.com"}, "background": "https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4104610?t=1772120974", "background_raw": "https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4104610?t=1772120974", "content_descriptors": {"ids": [], "notes": null}, "ratings": {"dejus": {"rating_generated": "1", "rating": "10", "required_age": "10", "banned":